# ***************
# Open boundaries
# ***************
# socal: all 4 boundaries open (wet points W 98, E 40, S 166, N 17). Hourly files Jan-Jun 2025 from
# gen_obcs_fast.py; UVEL/VVEL E/W/S transport-corrected, N uncorrected (correction rejected, see
# DECISIONS.md). useOBCSbalance (user decision 2026-10-08) removes the net inflow each step.
 &OBCS_PARM01
 OB_Jnorth =  168*-1,
 OB_Jsouth =  168*1,
 OB_Ieast  =  101*-1,
 OB_Iwest  =  101*1,
#
